<description>&lt;p&gt;Violence continues in Mexico with cartel-related incidents, including the sentencing of a Chinese operative for moving drugs for a Mexican terrorist cartel. Esteban Ocon denied physically assaulting a Haas team boss after the team replaced him with Ryo Hirakawa at the Mexico City Grand Prix. A small plane crashed shortly after takeoff in Mexico, killing the pilot and co-pilot. The conflict recorded 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE9LbHJTQ2xBMmVHaldLaDE1eUFiNnNocDdSQkZRd0dOQkdmTDFNUHZmY0lxbnNuZ19RaWYtQ3o4MlVDejlvXzFvVThrQlNxcGRkTzBOVExLMFNfVENkdTVrRGZzR3phTEdjS3hEUWk0X1NjeFRuejNPOFU5RQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNN&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOS3NqZl9NZmtSWGNlbWFwaFlzMmZiUjNEclVCV2J6eWlmUG9iclY2b0tJUXRwV05JemoxdHNXRmp6TTRYRFdrMGNiakJjQUI3ajFNc2ZJNjlxS0ZreXc1c25HOFNHNnVxSmwtdmdIV3BsTGRFeC1tZ0Q1Q2VpZ0tEME1tQWQzaEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sunday Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE54RmFYMXExS0NodS1pZnNBWko5bEhIS3FPVkJvZkpPS2J2MXd6RjNqaWdOVlF6dVhsZVlDdXU5a3JLWm1WY2RjcldWMjJfNjJtNHdXS195bmJvLVFybnR1ajBwb0lJRGRR?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPQzFyUl83bmNDdGlCT1NUSXpqLXBKWWNoWEhjVHBhQ1gzaTF3U3NremNjN25mWW8tZ2tEVG5NX3VvakNlVFhranF4RXZMREF6Z2NfWTBrU0hqTk9EbEstRVN6WXJzRHRiSmdtNG03YThjSnFHRUxseGNHRVB2SWJHdEp5UlZxMG1HaDhMbl95NnJBTGdxOVlHMU4wLTQ3VWh6MUlkSA?oc=5&quot;&gt;TicketNews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;voz.us&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cU